Produces clear, defensible temporal narratives the agent can verbalize:

> “Sentiment is declining sharply while volatility is rising — this is a fragmentation-driven crisis.”

This transforms raw timestamps into **temporal emotional intelligence**,
and emotional intelligence into **temporal foresight**.

